97:| joinery / signs | `dark_oak` (doors, fence brackets, `dark_oak_hanging_sign`, window boxes) | |
110:| flats' street door (double) | 23..24 | 7..8 | 19 | 2 wide x 2, `dark_oak_door` facing south; fanlight glass y 9 |
111:| keeper door tenant 1 | 7 | 7..8 | 2 | 1x2, into aisle z 3..4 |
112:| keeper door tenant 2 | 15 | 7..8 | 2 | 1x2 |
113:| stair-bay rear door | 23 | 7..8 | 2 | 1x2 (bins to the yard) |
115:| first-floor oriel glass | 7..9, 15..17 | 15..17 | 20 | 3 x 3 |
117:| second-floor oriel glass | 7..9, 15..17 | 19..21 | 20 | 3 x 3 |
119:| rear windows (both floors) | 6, 10, 14, 18, 23..24 | 15..16 and 20..21 | 2 | 1 x 2 (2 x 2 at the stair bay) |
120:| corridor doors through x 21 | 21 | 14..15 and 19..20 | 3 | 1x2, stair hall to flats corridor |
121:| flat doors off the corridor | 8 and 16 | 14..15 and 19..20 | 5 | 1x2, from corridor z 3..4 into each flat |
